            <p>In {PIW.month} the fastest group was <b id="iwg-top">–</b> and the slowest <b id="iwg-bot">–</b>. Food stood at <b id="iwg-food">–</b>, against <b id="iwg-food-y">–</b> a year earlier: <span id="iwg-food-dir">–</span>.</p>
