          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>The same day's work, priced in twenty states. These are rupees, not an index, so states can be compared directly, with one caution: a rupee buys more rice in some states than others, and this chart does not adjust for that. The other 24 occupations, from ploughing to plumbing, are in the data downloads and the every-cut table below.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="now">
            <span class="mk">As of {PWG.stamp}</span>
            <p>The wage runs from <b id="wgs-top">–</b> down to <b id="wgs-bot">–</b>: the best-paid state pays <b id="wgs-ratio">–</b> times the lowest for the same work. The All-India figure is <b id="wgs-ai">–</b>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
